{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"Kan 扩张"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Kan扩张"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于函子 $f\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\mathcal D$ 以及范畴 $\\mathcal E$, 有拉回函子\n$$\r\nf^*\\colon \\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\to \\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E).\r\n$$\n左右 Kan 扩张\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{LKE}_f,\\operatorname{RKE}_f\r\n\\colon \\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\to \\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\r\n$$\n即是 $f^*$ 的左右伴随.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>计算式</h3>\n<p>左右 Kan 扩张具有用余极限和极限的具体计算式:\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{LKE}_f (F)(d) = \\operatorname{colim}_{f(c) \\to d} F(c),\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{RKE}_f (F)(d) = \\operatorname{lim}_{d\\to f(c)} F(c).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>左</th><th>右</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>张量积 $\\otimes$</td><td>Hom</td></tr>\n<tr><td>余极限</td><td>极限</td></tr>\n<tr><td>几何实现 (realization)</td><td>全体 (totalization)</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>极限</h3>\n<p>对于指标范畴 $\\mathcal I$, 沿 $\\mathcal I\\to 1$ 的左右 Kan 扩张 $\\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathcal C$ 分别为余极限和极限:\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{LKE} (X) = \\operatorname{colim}_{i} X(i),\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{RKE} (X) = \\operatorname{lim}_{i} X(i).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>几何实现</h3>\n<p>$|{-}|\\colon \\Delta\\to\\mathsf {Top}$ 沿"},{"Local":{"url":"米田嵌入","text":"米田嵌入"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{y}\\colon \\Delta\\to\\mathsf {sSet}$ 的左 Kan 扩张 $\\mathsf {sSet}\\to\\mathsf {Top}$ 为单纯集的"},{"Local":{"url":"几何实现","text":"几何实现"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n|X| := \\operatorname{colim}_{\\Delta^n \\to X} |\\Delta^n|,\r\n$$\n其中 $\\Delta^n = \\mathbf{y}([n])$.</p>\n<h3>预层范畴之间的伴随</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"预层范畴之间的伴随","text":"预层范畴之间的伴随"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}